  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Aquarius Libs 是 aquariusplayz 旗下部分模組不可或缺的模組開發函式庫。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">它本身不會改變遊戲，但已實作多種函式與變數，能讓更新模組更加輕鬆</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">並讓模組開發者在建立模組時使用更少的程式碼。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此外，它還能讓使用此函式庫的模組之間溝通更為便捷</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">並大幅簡化後續的除錯與修復工作。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
